### Open questions

- **`Uri` icons.** The picker's dropdown items [take a `ThemeIcon` only](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/blob/1f6488722c942d1d7528a7d949769a69e4a557c3/src/vs/platform/actionWidget/browser/actionWidgetDropdown.ts#L49), and the picker button [looks for a `-compact` variant of a codicon](https://github.com/microsoft/vscode/blob/1f6488722c942d1d7528a7d949769a69e4a557c3/src/vs/workbench/contrib/chat/browser/widget/input/modelPicker/modelPickerWidget.ts#L810-L814). Supporting image `Uri`s needs UI work. A `ThemeIcon`-only first version would still cover most cases, because extensions can contribute their own glyphs through `contributes.icons`.
